# King's Pass on the shipping disc, no cheats: from the landing on the ledge, along the corridor
# (breaking the walls the corridor is shut with), up the shaft and along the top to the Great Door.
# Every goal is a position or a count the game publishes; nothing is timed through a fight.
at 34.5 11.39
walk 58.7
bash 8                                         # the first wall
walk 70.8
bash 8
walk 82.8
bash 8
walk 101.8
bash 8
walk 113.7                                     # the pit
at 113.75 9.39
hop 120.0 11.39                                # out of the pit onto the far rim
fight 3                                        # the Crawler on the rim
walk 126.7
bash 8                                         # the wall past the Crawler
walk 131.0
bash 8
walk 156.7 tol 0.1
